description.narrative:
Cumulative Outcome of The delay in the implementation of this activity linked to the impact of the Covid affected both the construction works but also the delivery of equipment, in particular those imported from abroad, technical assistance and the training of trainers. At the end of the Compact, the majority of the centers were in the process of being completed.

Concerning the planning, all the centers will be ready to welcome trainees next school year 2023/2024, insofar as the following conditions are met:
-Construction/Rehabilitation of the existing center;
- Defined training program;
-Equipped training center;
- PPP governance model defined and operational;
- Trained technical-pedagogical and administrative staff.

